From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:39:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Add strict transactional native creation admission

Prerequisite for the parent-owned CLI bridge, not wired to subprocesses yet. Preserve optional legacy receipts while strict local creation requires receipt-backed replay and atomic rollback. Refuse remote/selfwork/courier side effects and unadmitted overlap success. Proof: 66 focused tests, full scripts/check, four integration-anchor mutants killed. Remaining: full per-condition mutations, CLI bridge lifecycle and foreign-child registration.
